* SETEXIT FACE 3 -- WITH NO TRAP ARMED AND &ERRLIMIT NON-ZERO THE ERRORING STATEMENT
* TAKES ITS OWN FAILURE EXIT AND EXECUTION CONTINUES.  This is the half that has nothing
* to do with SETEXIT and everything to do with &ERRLIMIT.
	&ERRLIMIT = 10
	D = 0
	X = 1 / D		:F(NEXT)
	OUTPUT = "NOFAIL"
NEXT	OUTPUT = "CONTINUED"
END
